unity/windows_exporter/pull/2813\n### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n• logical_disk：fall back to GetDiskFreeSpaceEx when GetDiskSpaceInformationW fails by @jkroepke in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2805\n• scheduled_task：skip tasks and folders deleted during a scrape by @jkroepke in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2811\n• update：fail searches that Windows Update reports as failed by @jkroepke in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2808\n• process：resolve owner SIDs per scrape and retry failed lookups by @jkroepke in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2801\n• dhcp：free leaked scope buffers and keep readable scopes by @jkroepke in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2809\n• service：keep services whose configuration can't be read by @jkroepke in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2810\n• installer：fix config.yaml on uninstall and set InstallLocation by @jkroepke in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2814\n### 🛠️ Dependencies\n• chore(deps)：update module github.com/prometheus/procfs to v0.23.0 (main) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2795\n### 📖 Documentation\n• docs(agents)：link the Windows protocol specifications by @jkroepke in https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/pull/2806\n\n\n**Full Changelog**：https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/compare/v0.32.0...v0.32.1","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/releases/tag/v0.32.1","tags":["prometheus","prometheus-exporter","windows","wmi"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/prometheus-community","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/prometheus-community/windows_exporter/releases/tag/v0.3